2026-06-23 03:30:33,758 [INFO]     trigger needs >=2 own bars. SMA_TRAIL_MIN_BARS (4, bars-of-day) is now only
2026-06-23 03:30:33,758 [INFO]     the fallback when entry_time is unknown (state-load edge). NOT a BE-gate.
